# mcp__codebase_memory_index_status — codebase-memory/index_status

Project readiness, counts, root, watch state, coverage gaps, and doc_links (doc-comment references: MENTIONS edges, unresolved by reason). diagnostics adds coverage rows; verbose adds Git paths. Best-effort only; verify cited paths with check_index_coverage.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  project: string;
  /** Add worktree/shadow Git paths for index-location debugging. */
  verbose?: boolean;
  /** Coverage rows: counts, five samples, or up to 500. */
  diagnostics?: "none" | "summary" | "full";
  format?: "tree" | "json";
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://mcp__codebase_memory_index_status.

